      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 6.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "mm, uh, sorry I'm a little late, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.68,
      "end_seconds": 13.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "of course, leave it there how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.81,
      "end_seconds": 23.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Yeah, it's shaking chills and a high temperature. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.06,
      "end_seconds": 34.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.49,
      "end_seconds": 41.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.52,
      "end_seconds": 44.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.35,
      "end_seconds": 59.62,
      "duration_seconds": 14.27,
      "text": "Very little urine goes along with it, most of the time. I've, I've also been feeling confused. The Very little urine? That's been for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.63,
      "end_seconds": 63.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "what about stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.85,
      "end_seconds": 74.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "well, um, not at all, no stiff neck"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.21,
      "end_seconds": 78.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Any chest pain or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.15,
      "end_seconds": 83.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "No, you know, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.81,
      "end_seconds": 86.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.53,
      "end_seconds": 91.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Um, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.14,
      "end_seconds": 101.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.24,
      "end_seconds": 104.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.05,
      "end_seconds": 109.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.51,
      "end_seconds": 114.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Heart disease, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.61,
      "end_seconds": 119.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "So, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.53,
      "end_seconds": 132.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.25,
      "text": "Hmm, I take aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. I had clopidogrel at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.71,
      "end_seconds": 150.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.26,
      "end_seconds": 156.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.9,
      "end_seconds": 158.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.57,
      "end_seconds": 163.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.14,
      "end_seconds": 168.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.86,
      "end_seconds": 175.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.48,
      "end_seconds": 197.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "okay, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.4,
      "end_seconds": 204.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Tramadol. I come out in... well, feeling very drowsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.3,
      "end_seconds": 208.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.04,
      "end_seconds": 223.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.83,
      "end_seconds": 248.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "okay: pulse 97, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, blood pressure 110 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.63,
      "end_seconds": 253.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.58,
      "end_seconds": 256.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.85,
      "end_seconds": 259.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.52,
      "end_seconds": 284.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "You are hot, your heart is racing and your blood pressure is low, which worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.38,
      "end_seconds": 318.27,
      "duration_seconds": 27.89,
      "text": "Right, you can sit up now. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably possible sepsis needing urgent treatment. It could also be a severe urine or chest infection, so we'll keep that open. I want lactate and blood tests done, that's for sepsis. I wanna admit you to hospital now for fluids and antibiotics. Come back straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.5,
      "end_seconds": 326.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Mm, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.62,
      "end_seconds": 328.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}